    <h2 class="section-title" id="no-code">No-code</h2>
    <p class="lead">
        No time in IT? No problem — for static pages we have ready-made
        solutions. Our overlay service covers all your needs: you paste one
        script and the configuration handles the rest.
    </p>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/no-code/article-1/">
            <span class="badge">blur · 1.45 PLN</span>
            <h3>The invisible checkout</h3>
            <p>A long article, content blurred behind a paywall.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/no-code/article-2/">
            <span class="badge">hide · 2.50 PLN</span>
            <h3>The town that read the fine print</h3>
            <p>Content hidden, the overlay removes it from the DOM.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/no-code/article-3/">
            <span class="badge">mangle-blur · 2.00 PLN</span>
            <h3>The last hand-made page</h3>
            <p>Blur plus mangled words.</p>
        </a>
